- LICENSES/Apache-2.0.md (was LICENSE.md): the Apache License 2.0 text, unchanged.
- pyproject.toml: distribution renamed to llmw2, the reference agent
  and its Google dependencies removed, llmw2 package added.
- .gitignore: entries added.

